WEBVTT

NOTE
Japanese subtitles for the English voice-over, for docs/slides/ja/. The clip
also carries the tab's own Japanese talk and, later, the same talk interpreted
into English and then Chinese; those are the demo working rather than someone
explaining it, so they get a line saying what you are hearing instead of a
translation of it. Cue times are media time, so they survive the deck playing
the clip at 1.15x.

From 23s on, the extension is painting its own subtitles across the bottom of
the tab, which is the thing the demo is showing; those two cues carry line:0 so
they sit over the browser toolbar instead of covering it.

